#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"Data are commonly obtained from external sources such as from other files, "
"either in a spreadsheet format or in delimited text format, from other "
"applications using the mouse to copy and paste data or from external "
"applications such as databases or internet data streams."
msgstr ""
"Data hämtas ofta från externa källor: andra filer i kalkylblads- eller "
"avgränsat textformat, andra program via kopiera och klistra in eller externa"
" tjänster som databaser och dataströmmar från internet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:15
msgid ""
"Data which already exist in an external file can be imported into a workbook"
" first by opening the file into a separate instance of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> and then by copying the relevant data "
"into the desired worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Data i en extern fil kan importeras till en arbetsbok genom att du först "
"öppnar filen i en separat instans av <application>Gnumeric</application> och"
" därefter kopierar relevanta data till önskat kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:22
msgid ""
"Data contained in external files in the formats of several other spreadsheet"
" applications can be opened by <application>Gnumeric</application>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can open files in "
"<application>Applix</application> (TM) format, GNU "
"<application>Oleo</application> format, Lotus <application>123</application>"
" (TM) format, Microsoft <application>Excel</application> (TM) format, "
"<application>Multiplan</application> (TM) format, OpenOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> or StarOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> (TM) format, <application>Plan "
"Perfect</application> (TM) format, <application>Quattro Pro</application> "
"(TM) format, <application>sc</application> and "
"<application>XSpread</application> format or in the "
"<application>Xbase</application> format."
msgstr ""
"Filer i format från flera andra program för kalkylblad kan öppnas med "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan"
" läsa filer i formaten <application>Applix</application> (TM), GNU "
"<application>Oleo</application>, Lotus <application>123</application> (TM), "
"Microsoft <application>Excel</application> (TM), "
"<application>Multiplan</application> (TM), OpenOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> och StarOffice "
"<application>Calc</application> (TM), <application>Plan "
"Perfect</application> (TM), <application>Quattro Pro</application> (TM), "
"<application>sc</application> och <application>XSpread</application> samt "
"<application>Xbase</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:40
msgid ""
"Data contained in external text files which are formatted in well defined "
"ways can also be opened by <application>Gnumeric</application>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can open files formatted in Data "
"Interchange Format, formatted as HTML tables, or formatted in text formats "
"such as comma separated values or tab delimited records. The opening of text"
" format files is configurable by the user so that text files which contain "
"data formatted in a wide variety of schemes can be imported correctly into "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. Obtaining data from these files is "
"explained in detail in the section titled <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"open\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Textfiler med en väldefinierad struktur kan också öppnas i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan"
" öppna filer i Data Interchange Format, HTML-tabeller och textformat som "
"kommaseparerade värden eller tabbseparerade poster. Du kan anpassa hur "
"textfiler öppnas så att filer med olika upplägg importeras korrekt i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>. Läs mer om hur du hämtar data från "
"sådana filer i avsnittet <xref linkend=\"sect-file-open\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:55
msgid ""
"Data which are opened into a separate instance of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can be copied and pasted into the "
"current worksheet with the copy and paste commands as explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-cutandpaste\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Data som öppnats i en separat instans av <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" kan kopieras och klistras in i det aktuella kalkylbladet med kommandona "
"Kopiera och Klistra in, som beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-"
"cutandpaste\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:67
msgid ""
"Data can be obtained from other <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"workbooks or other applications using the mouse to copy data and paste them "
"into a worksheet. This is explained below in the section titled <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan hämta data från andra arbetsböcker i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> eller från andra program genom att "
"kopiera dem med musen och klistra in dem i ett kalkylblad. Detta beskrivs i "
"avsnittet <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:90
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> has been connected to external data "
"sources such as stock quotation service data streams using an experimental "
"plugin. This requires the ability to write programming code. Information on "
"extending <application>Gnumeric</application> by developing plugins can be "
"found in the section called <xref linkend=\"sect-extending-plugins\"/> and "
"the actual computer source code can be found in the directory "
"<literal>gnumeric/plugins/sample_datasource/</literal> of either a "
"distribution of <application>Gnumeric</application> or in a code checkout "
"from the revision control repository."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har med hjälp av en experimentell "
"insticksmodul kopplats till externa datakällor, till exempel dataflöden från"
" aktiekurser. Detta kräver att du kan skriva programkod. Läs om hur du "
"utökar <application>Gnumeric</application> med insticksmoduler i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-extending-plugins\"/>. Källkoden finns i katalogen "
"<literal>gnumeric/plugins/sample_datasource/</literal>, antingen i en "
"distribution av <application>Gnumeric</application> eller i en lokal kopia "
"som hämtats från versionshanteringsarkivet."
